OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright but cold initially
OL,6,Facross Cumbria and along Irish Sea
OL,7,Fcoasts. Elsewhere, a cloudy morning
OL,8,Fwith some showery rain, though skies
OL,9,Fmay gradually brighten later.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average with an
OL,11,Feasterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSkies clearing this evening
OL,14,Fwill bring a cold start to the night
OL,15,Fwith isolated frost. Cloud returns
OL,16,Ffrom the east later, perhaps bringing
OL,17,Fa few spots of rain by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
